# Normalize EOL for all files that Git considers text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制素材：不做 EOL 转换 / 文本 diff / 合并。
# 这些路径以前走 Git LFS，现在直接存普通 git 对象 —— clone 不再需要装 git-lfs。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.exr binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.obj binary
*.fbx binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.blend binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
